# Dark Web Tools Research

## Purpose
This directory contains ongoing research into dark web monitoring tools, search engines, and monitoring platforms.

## Research Categories
- [OSINT Frameworks](categories/osint_tools.md) - Comprehensive OSINT automation tools
- [Exposure Monitoring](categories/monitoring_tools.md) - Ransomware leak site and breach monitoring
- [Search Engines](categories/search_engines.md) - Dark web search engines and directories
- [Commercial Solutions](commercial_solutions.md) - Enterprise dark web monitoring services
- [Breach Monitoring](breach_monitoring.md) - Compromised data and credential monitoring

## Update Frequency
- Tools are reviewed monthly for new features and platform support
- Rankings updated quarterly based on community adoption and features
- New tools added when they gain significant traction or unique capabilities

## Contributing Research
1. Submit new tool discoveries via Pull Request
2. Update tool rankings based on latest data
3. Add platform support information (Windows/Linux)
4. Document new features and capabilities

## Research Notes
- All tools evaluated on: features, platform support, community adoption, update frequency, documentation quality
- Ranking scale: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (excellent) to ⭐ (experimental)
- Legal/ethical notice applies to all research activities